{"resourceIdentifier":"2327","resourceName":"Guangxi Huanjiang IFM (conversion of logged to protected forest) Project","description":"The Guangxi Huanjiang IFM (conversion of logged to protected forest) Project  (hereafter “the project activity”) is implemented in Huanjiang Maonan Autonomous County, Hechi City,Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region of China by Huanjiang Maonan Autonomous County Huashan Forestry Investment Co., Ltd, the geo-coordinate of the  project  is  107°51′E~108°43′E and 24°44′N~25°33′N, which includes  the  Improved  Forest  Management  (IFM)  of  the forests in the conversion of logged to protected forest.\r\nThe area of the project activity is 9,346.72 ha, including 1,306 subcompartments spreading over Huashan forest farm, Chuanshan Town, Dongxing Town, Luoyang Town, Minglun Town, Shuiyuan Town, Si’en Town, Da’an Township, Lonyan Township, Tiancai Township, Xianan Township, Xunle Township, Changmei Township of Huanjiang Maonan Autonomous County. All these forests are state-owned forests or privately-owned or collective-owned, and have the legal right to forest ownership. All the owners authorized the project proponent to access the project to their behalf. The species involved in the project are Broad-leaved tree, Chinese fir and Pinus massoniana.\r\nBefore the implementation of the project activity, the trees are logged based on a valid and verifiable government-approved timber management plan for harvesting the project area. The implementation of the project activity converses the trees to protected forest to reduce the GHG emissions for about 1,079,852 tCO2e in 20 years, the average annual emission reduction is 53,992 tCO2e and Verified Carbon Units with buffer deduction is about 831,476 tCO2e in 20 years, and average annual VCUs with buffer deduction is 41,573 tCO2e.\r\nThe project activity will contribute to the environment (biodiversity conservation, rocky desertification prevention and soil erosion control), thus contribute to sustainable development.","location":{"latitude":25.529157,"longitude":108.699007},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-09-08","endExclusive":"2020-10-09","endInclusive":"2020-10-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2327"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Huanjiang Maonan Autonomous County Huashan Forestry Investment Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Guangxi, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"On Hold - see notification letter"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2327"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2327"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"53992"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":162817}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"IFM"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0010"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"9347 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"TÜV NORD CERT GmbH"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"28/07/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/07/2016 - 30/06/2036"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=47728&IDKEY=0lksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098k65816912","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"Guangxi Huanjiang IFM (conversion of logged 